ET:"Shy Guy Talk";MG:"What's that you say you have been in the Illusion world before? Hm... Well\, I guess I better to explain. The world with a background is the Dream World. In that world\, some strange things happen\, but not has much in the Illusion World. Also\, there are less enemies in the illusion world!";TE:"Shy Guy Talk 2";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Shy Guy Talk 2";MG:"However\, in this world\, there are harder enemies and most likely\, bosses... However\, if you learn how to control these two worlds\, you can achieve perfect balance!";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
